{"parentUuid":"7b6b25ec-28e5-4e82-b8f1-2b7b82b43f08","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfzdxLvtCRCufe5woAfQp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"（\"边管\"我理解成 Background。）\n\n我起了一个验证子代理（background-subagent-check），限时 8 分钟。它在自己的 tmux 里开一个 `agents`，选中我们这个会话（add-codex-support），盯着详情面板的 Background 看。\n\n为了同时有\"在干活\"和\"已经做完\"的子代理，我让之前做完调研的 codex-support-research 再干一个大约 150 秒的活：\n\n- **在干活的时候**：Background 要显示它和验证子代理自己，另外两个做完的（background-stop-research、provider-architecture）不该出现。\n- **干完以后**：它要从 Background 里消失，验证子代理自己还在。\n- **左边列表**：那个会话下面挂着哪些子代理行、各是什么状态，只记录，不判对错。\n\n每个阶段它都会截一次屏，文字格式的，存到 scratchpad 的 `background-check/` 下。\n\n在跑：验证子代理，codex-support-research 那个 150 秒的活。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2258,"cache_read_input_tokens":242536,"output_tokens":344,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2258,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":344,"cache_read_input_tokens":242536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2258,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2258},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"227bc32c-4b08-45a4-9853-36a19b569056","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CfzdxLaYHFW3Lt5aLJHCQ","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd44e227-1c38-4d59-aaae-3febe8990549","timestamp":"2026-10-13T17:33:58.127Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"0ed4978e-9ece-4b9d-9bc5-04bf44fedacb","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/example-user/Code/blockchainian